    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "evolving is just a nice way of saying 'failing slowly.' i don't want to 'evolve' into someone who struggles to write a single decent melody. i remember what it felt like when the music just flowed, when it was pure. now it's just work, and it's bad work. if i keep going, i'm just dragging my name through the mud. i'd rather just walk away now while the memory of my best work is still intact. isn't there some dignity in knowing when to quit before you become a joke?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
